# public/_opt (the generated image derivatives) is deliberately COMMITTED.
# Encoding them on the deploy host took over Vercel's 45-minute build limit, so
# they ship with the repo instead and `prebuild` becomes a fast no-op.
# Re-run `npm run images` and commit the result after adding images.

# Source material the site does not reference, kept on disk by
# `node scripts/move-unused.mjs` but deliberately out of the repo and the deploy.
